 534+ C1EA 08               ex af,af
 535+ C1EB
 536+ C1EB AF               xor a                   ; Black BORDER.
 537+ C1EC D3 FE            out ($fe),a             ; Semiciclo NEGATIVO de la onda, BEEPER OFF.
 538+ C1EE
 539+ C1EE 08               ex af,af
 540+ C1EF
 541+ C1EF 47               ld b,a
 542+ C1F0
 543+ C1F0 10 FE        Delay_8 djnz Delay_8
